              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, Daudi ariphoona Mwenyezi Mlungu akamjibu kahi ya pho phatu pha kuwagira pha Orinani, Mjebusi, wakala achilavira sadakaze phatu hipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
