          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Daudi kayasubutu kuphiya Gibioni kpwendauza mapendzi ga Mlungu, mana kala anatishirwa ni hinyo upanga wa malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
